    "prompt": {
      "description": "A stocky armored standard-bearer in heavy plate. Oversized head in an open-faced helm with a flat top, no visor and no crest, broad blunt face. Squared pauldrons make a flat horizontal shoulder line; short thick legs with the feet close together, so the whole body reads as a narrow upright column. One hand grips a dead-straight vertical pole at the hip; the pole rises well clear above the head and carries a small plain rectangular banner of undecorated cloth, burning bright. The other hand hangs empty at the side. Boxy build, hard straight edges, everything squared off.",
      "must_include": [
        "flat horizontal shoulder line, unbroken by collar or cloth",
        "dead-vertical pole gripped at hip height, rising clear above the head",
        "small rectangular banner with four straight edges, clear of the head",
        "open face under the helm, no visor",
        "narrow upright body, feet close together"
      ],
      "must_avoid": [
        "cape or cloak",
        "swallowtail, forked, torn or curving banner edges",
        "any device, emblem or writing on the banner",
        "helm crest, plume, wings or horns",
        "glow, halo, sparks or rays around any pixel",
        "bright or glowing eyes",
        "diagonal or shouldered pole",
        "wide planted stance",
        "lantern, torch or bowl held in the hand"
      ],
      "style_mode": "flat"
